024-11-11T06:46:33Z","body":"I sent a PR #99013 for 4.4 which partially supersedes this PR.\r\n\r\nSo, since there are two fixes in this PR, can you separate only the fix for the pressing Shift behavior for 4.4? The Second mode fix must be removed from this PR and sent separately in the as new PR as cherry-pick for 4.3.\r\n\r\nIn other words, this PR is directed to `master` branch and needs to remove the line conflicting with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99013. But it is fine to duplicate this commit and create a new PR with directing to `4.3` branch.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467002688/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467684359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98826#issuecomment-2467684359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98826","id":2467684359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TFeAH","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":